Rocky Owl's Christmas Story is based on the true tale of an owl that delighted the world when he was discovered in the spruce tree that lit up Manhattan's Rockefeller Center. This playful interactive book comes with a read for me option (narrated by best-selling author Jane Adams), touch screen animation, holiday music, and sound effects. Fun for the whole family.  Features:

- Read for Me or I Will Read option (18 pages); 
- Touch screen sound and animated effects: Owl, Truck, Saw, lighting of Christmas Tree;
- Other sound effects: "Oh Christmas Tree" instrumental; jingle on page turn, crowd noise & cheering, french horn;
- Enable/disable sound effects by turning device silent mode on/off.
- White ornament on bottom left screen is the home button. 

Written and narrated by best-selling author, Jane Adams.
Produced by ImmersiveKid LLC.
Music : O Christmas Tree Instrumental - https://youtu.be/wBfKKSIBzds
